SOURCE_BIND S1
  SOURCE E1135
  SYMBOL collatzStep
  READS_AS the full map, n over two when Even n, three n plus one otherwise, one step per application
  DISTINCT_FROM the Syracuse shortcut map T
  WHY_DISTINCT T sends odd n to three n plus one over two in ONE step, so every step count, every iterate index and every descent witness differs on every odd n
  FINGERPRINT 1fa9d777f34cbfe9e023e864049b8499a970b949ed7b32a1f5dc93054de1064f

SOURCE_BIND S2
